in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> property. If thrown, it will immediately reappear in your hand.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Elemental_Cleaver:_Cold\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Cleaver:_Cold_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Cleaver: Cold (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/db/Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Cleaver: Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/db/Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/db/Elemental_Cleaver_Cold_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Cleaver:_Cold_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Cleaver: Cold (Condition)\">Elemental Cleaver: Cold</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Channelling primordial might. Until the end of your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\">Rage</a>, your weapon will deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> and gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> property. If thrown, it will immediately reappear in your hand.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Elemental_Cleaver:_Fire\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Cleaver:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Cleaver: Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Cleaver: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Elemental_Cleaver_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Cleaver:_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Elemental Cleaver: Fire (Condition)\">Elemental Cleaver: Fire</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Channelling primordial might. Until the end of your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\">Rage</a>, your weapon will deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> and gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><spa